[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0902","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0902.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21639","title":"Linux kernel SCTP 协议栈 sysctl rto_min/max 处理空指针引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCTP 协议的 sysctl 处理存在空指针解引用漏洞。在 sctp 的 rto_min/rto_max 系统配置处理器中，代码通过 current->nsproxy 获取 net 结构体，但该指针在某些情况下（如当前任务正在退出，syzbot 通过 acct(2) 触发）可能为 NULL，导致空指针解引用引发内核崩溃（Oops/null-ptr-deref）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 3.13 及更高版本，攻击需本地权限（低权限），攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，成功利用可导致拒绝服务（系统崩溃），属于 NULL 指针解引用类漏洞（CWE-476）。官方已通过改用 container_of() 从 table->data 获取 net 结构的方式修复该问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21639"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:54Z","remediation":"立即升级内核至包含该修复的版本。该漏洞通过 Linux 内核 git 稳定分支的补丁提交修复（如 git.kernel.org/stable/c/0f78f094 等），受影响主线版本应升级到包含该 commit 的 6.13 及更高版本。各发行版请安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu 安装 USN-7381-1 内核更新、Debian 11 应用 DLA-4075、SUSE 应用 SUSE-SU-2025:0847 提供的已修复内核包。若无法立即打补丁，可采取缓解措施：限制低权限用户在命名空间内触发 SCTP 相关 sysctl 读写操作，并避免调用 acct(2) 造成任务退出期间并发读取 netns 配置的场景，降低空指针引用崩溃（DoS）被触发的概率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0f78f09466744589e420935e646ae78212a38290","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/246428bfb9e7db15c5cd08e1d0eca41b65af2b06","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4059507e34aa5fe0fa9fd5b2b5f0c8b26ab2d482","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9fc17b76fc70763780aa78b38fcf4742384044a5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c87f1f6ade56c711f8736901e330685b453e420e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c8d179f3b1c1d60bf4484f50aa67b4c70f91bff9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc9d0e3cfd16f66fbf0862857c6b391c8613ca9f","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21639.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21639.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21639.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21639.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21639.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21639.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21639.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21639.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21639.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21639-2025-11-03-1452"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0902.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0901","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0901.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21638","title":"Linux kernel SCTP 子系统 auth_enable 系统配置空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCTP 协议栈的 auth_enable sysctl 配置处理器存在空指针解引用漏洞。由于该处理器通过 current->nsproxy 获取 net 网络命名空间结构，而未采用更为稳妥的方式从 sysctl 表数据（table->data）中提取，当任务进程正在退出时 current->nsproxy 可能为 NULL，从而引发空指针解引用（空指针解引用，CWE-476），导致内核崩溃（Oops）。该漏洞需要在本地环境中执行，攻击者若具备相应权限，在满足特定时序条件下可利用 acct 等系统调用触发该问题，造成系统拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核的 SCTP 认证使能配置路径，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级为高。内核开发团队已建议改用 container_of() 从 table->data 获取 net 结构，以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21638"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:16:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至包含该修复提交的版本（kernel commit 将 SCTP sysctl auth_enable 处理器中获取 net 结构的方式改为通过 table->data 使用 container_of()，避免引用 current->nsproxy），主要发行版修复版本如下：内核主线修复于 6.13 之前，请更新至包含该补丁的稳定内核；SUSE SLES15 SP6 建议安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0847-1 更新；Debian 11 请应用 DLA-4075 更新；Ubuntu 24.04/22.04/20.04 安装 USN-7381-1、USN-7459-1 对应内核包。在无法立即打补丁时，可限制低权限本地用户创建 SCTP 套接字或对含 SCTP 的内核配置启用 sysctl netns 隔离，并监控 dmesg 中与 sysctl auth_enable 相关的 Oops 空指针错误，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/15649fd5415eda664ef35780c2013adeb5d9c695","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1b67030d39f2b00f94ac1f0af11ba6657589e4d3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7ec30c54f339c640aa7e49d7e9f7bbed6bd42bf6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd2a2939423566c654545fa3e96a656662a0af9e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c184bc621e3cef03ac9ba81a50dda2dae6a21d36","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cf387cdebfaebae228dfba162f94c567a67610c3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc583e7e5f8515ca489c0df28e4362a70eade382","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21638.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21638.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21638.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21638.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21638.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21638.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21638-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21638-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21638.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/edbeec8f0d16e85a3e6ef588978e47a49091e51a/2025/CVE-2025-21638.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0901.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0900","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21637","title":"Linux kernel SCTP sysctl udp_port 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Linux 内核 SCTP 协议栈的 sysctl udp_port 处理函数存在空指针解引用漏洞。该函数通过 current->nsproxy 指针获取网络命名空间结构，但在当前任务退出等特定场景下（如 syzbot 利用 acct(2) 系统调用所发现的），该指针可能为 NULL，导致内核发生空指针解引用（Oops）并触发系统崩溃，造成拒绝服务攻击。受影响版本包括所有采用该脆弱代码路径的 Linux 内核发行版。攻击者需要在目标系统上拥有低权限本地访问权限，无需任何用户交互即可在触发条件满足时利用此漏洞，直接影响系统可用性并可能损害数据完整性。开发者已通过将 net 结构体获取方式从 current->nsproxy 改为从 table->data 使用 container_of() 来修复该问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21637"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:16:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：Debian 12 (bookworm) 升级至 6.1.128-1 或更高，Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 升级至 5.15.0-1077.83 或更高。执行 `apt update && apt install linux-image-$(uname -r)` 后重启系统使新内核生效。如暂无法升级，可通过限制本地低权限用户对 SCTP sysctl 接口的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a0966312ac3eedd7f5f2a766ed4702df39a9a65","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/55627918febdf9d71107a1e68d1528dc591c9a15","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5b77d73f3be5102720fb685b9e6900e3500e1096","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c10377bbc1972d858eaf0ab366a311b39f8ef1b6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e919197fb8616331f5dc81e4c3cc3d12769cb725","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21637.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21637.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21637.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21637.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21637.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21637.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21637.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21637.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21637-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21637.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0899","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0899.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21636","title":"Linux Kernel SCTP sysctl plpmtud_probe_interval 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux kernel 的 SCTP 协议 sysctl 接口在处理 plpmtud_probe_interval 参数时，通过 current->nsproxy 获取网络命名空间结构。该代码路径在进程退出等场景下（例如通过 acct(2) 系统调用）可能导致 current->nsproxy 为 NULL，引发空指针解引用（null-ptr-deref）漏洞，造成内核崩溃。攻击者作为本地低权限用户，可利用此漏洞触发内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响包含受影响 SCTP sysctl 代码的 Linux 内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21636"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:53Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含修复的稳定版本：5.15.177、6.1.125、6.6.72、6.12.10 或更高版本。主流发行版用户请执行包管理器更新：Ubuntu/Debian 运行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image，RHEL/CentOS 运行 yum update kernel，SUSE 运行 zypper update kernel。如使用自定义内核，请应用包含 commit 6259d2484d0c（net/sctp/sysctl.c: 将 current->nsproxy->net_ns 替换为 container_of(ctl->data, struct net, sctp.probe_interval)）的补丁后重新编译。临时缓解措施：以 root 权限通过 sysctl 将 net.sctp.probe_interval 设为 0 可关闭路径 MTU 发现探测功能，降低触发概率，但可能影响大包传输性能。升级后重启系统使新内核生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1dc5da6c4178f3e4b95c631418f72de9f86c0449","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/284a221f8fa503628432c7bb5108277c688c6ffa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/44ee8635922b6eb940faddb961a8347c6857d722","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6259d2484d0ceff42245d1f09cc8cb6ee72d847a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bcf8c60074e81ed2ac2d35130917175a3949c917","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21636.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21636.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21636.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21636.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21636.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21636.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21636.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21636.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21636-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21636.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0899.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0898","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0898.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21635","title":"Linux Kernel RDS 协议空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RDS（可靠数据报套接字）子系统的 sysctl 处理程序中存在空指针解引用漏洞。在处理 rds_tcp_rcvbuf 和 rds_tcp_sndbuf 参数时，代码通过 current->nsproxy 获取网络命名空间结构，但在某些场景下（如进程正在退出时执行 acct(2) 系统调用），current->nsproxy 可能为 NULL，导致内核发生空指针解引用（Oops）。该漏洞影响运行受影响 Linux 内核版本的本地系统，具有本地低权限用户可利用的特点，成功利用可导致系统崩溃或拒绝服务。CVSS v3.1 评分为 5.5，危害等级为中等。攻击者需要具备本地访问权限并运行恶意代码才能触发此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21635"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:53Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.10 或更高版本（含 6.13 系列），该修复已通过内核提交 de8d6de0ee27 和 7f5611cbc487 合入主线，修复了 net/rds/tcp.c 中 RDS 子系统 sysctl 处理函数通过 current-&gt;nsproxy 获取网络命名空间时空指针解引用的问题。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户应安装 linux-image-6.8.0-60.63 或更高版本（USN-7381-1），升级后需重启系统使新内核生效。对于无法立即升级的内核版本 4.6 至 6.12.9，可通过 sysctl 禁用 RDS 协议模块（执行 echo 1 &gt; /proc/sys/net/core/rds_conn_debug 或卸载 rds 内核模块）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7f5611cbc4871c7fb1ad36c2e5a9edad63dca95c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de8d6de0ee27be4b2b1e5b06f04aeacbabbba492","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21635.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21635.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21635.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21635.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21635.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21635.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21635.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21635.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21635.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3231978c760368f8f6b5637cdf1c49798e2fdc5/2025/CVE-2025-21635.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0898.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0897","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0897.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21634","title":"Linux kernel cgroup cpuset 不当锁定拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux kernel cgroup/cpuset 子系统中，cpuset_write_resmask() 函数调用 kernfs_break_active_protection 解除 kernfs 活跃保护机制，当进程向 cpuset.cpus 写入的同时，另一个进程执行 cgroup rmdir 删除操作，两者并发触发 kernfs 引用计数不一致，导致内核产生警告并可能引发死锁。该漏洞影响使用 cgroup cpuset 控制器的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地低权限用户身份，通过在写入 cpuset 配置与删除 cgroup 之间制造竞态窗口来触发。该问题可导致系统稳定性下降或拒绝服务，Linux 内核已通过移除 kernfs_break_active_protection 调用修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21634"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:53Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Linux 内核 6.13 或更高版本，该版本修复了 cgroup/cpuset 中的 kernfs 活动中断警告。升级时请检查内核版本，确保版本号 ≥6.13。如无法立即升级，可临时修改 /etc/modules 配置以禁用 cpuset 内核模块以缓解风险。升级后需重启系统以使修复生效，具体补丁请参考 kernel.org 提供的修复提交。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/11cb1d643a74665a4e14749414f48f82cbc15c64","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3cb97a927fffe443e1e7e8eddbfebfdb062e86ed","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21634.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21634.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21634.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21634.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21634.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21634.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21634.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21634.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21634.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21634"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0897.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0896","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0896.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21631","title":"Linux 内核 BFQ I/O 调度器释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核块层 BFQ I/O 调度器存在释放后重用漏洞（CWE-416）。在调用 bfq_split_bfqq() 函数拆分请求队列后，waker_bfqq 指针指向的内存已被释放，但后续代码仍通过 bfq_init_rq() 中的 hlist_add_head 操作访问该已释放内存，导致内核 slab 被非法读写。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.6 及之前版本中启用 BFQ 调度器的系统。攻击者需在本地拥有低权限访问权限（PR:L），可通过发起大量文件系统 I/O 操作（如 ext4 目录遍历或 ioctl FIEMAP）触发竞争条件，成功利用可导致权限提升、敏感数据泄露或系统拒绝服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21631"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T11:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:53Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至以下已修复版本之一：5.15.177、6.1.125、6.6.72、6.11 或 6.12.10。可通过发行版包管理器执行更新，如 Debian/Ubuntu 运行 apt upgrade linux-image，RHEL/CentOS 运行 dnf update kernel。如暂无法升级，可通过内核启动参数 elevator=deadline 或 elevator=mq-deadline 禁用 BFQ 调度器，或通过 grub 设置 GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT 添加 \"elevator=mq-deadline\" 后运行 update-grub 并重启。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2550149fcdf2934155ff625d76ad4e3d4b25bbc6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bc2aeb35ff167e0c6b0cedf0c96a5c41e6cba1ed","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/be3eed59ac01f429ac10aaa46e26f653bcf581ab","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f587c1ac68956c4703857d650d9b1cd7bb2ac4d7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fcede1f0a043ccefe9bc6ad57f12718e42f63f1d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21631.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21631.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21631.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21631.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21631.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21631.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21631.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21631.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21631-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21631.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0896.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0860","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0860.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21399","title":"Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 更新特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Edge（基于 Chromium）的更新组件存在不受信任的搜索路径漏洞（CWE-426）。本地攻击者可通过在特定目录中放置恶意的 DLL 文件，利用 Edge 更新程序加载外部库时的路径搜索机制缺陷，以系统权限执行任意代码，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Edge 132.0.2957.115 之前版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21399"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-17T20:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:16Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Edge Update 升级到 1.3.195.43 或更高版本（2025 年 1 月 16 日发布），同时将 Microsoft Edge 浏览器升级到 132.0.2957.115 或更高版本（2025 年 1 月 17 日发布）。可通过 edge://settings/help 检查并自动更新，企业用户可通过 Microsoft Update 或 WSUS 批量推送。该漏洞源于 Edge Update 组件的不安全搜索路径（CWE-426），攻击者可通过在搜索路径中放置恶意 DLL 实现本地提权。临时缓解措施：限制非管理员用户对 Edge Update 安装目录（默认 %ProgramFiles(x86)%\\Microsoft\\EdgeUpdate\\）的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21399","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/elevation-of-privilege-vulnerability-in-microsoft-edge-chromium-based-detection-script","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/elevation-of-privilege-vulnerability-in-microsoft-edge-chromium-based-mitigation-script","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21399.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21399.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21399.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21399.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21399.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21399.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21399.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21399.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21399.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21399/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0860.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0647","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0647.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21185","title":"Microsoft Edge 基于 Chromium 的特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Edge（基于 Chromium）存在权限提升漏洞，源于对某些页面资源的访问控制（CWE-284）实现不当。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的恶意网页，利用该漏洞绕过 Edge 的安全限制，获取本应受限的敏感信息（如浏览器内部数据或其他源的内容），导致机密性受损。该漏洞影响 132.0.2957.115 之前版本的 Microsoft Edge，攻击复杂度低，无需提前获取用户权限，但需要用户交互配合。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21185"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-17T20:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:43Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Edge 升级至 132.0.2957.115 或更高版本。可通过浏览器访问 edge://settings/help 触发自动检查更新并安装。企业用户可通过 Microsoft Intune 或组策略批量推送更新。如无法立即升级，可在 Edge 中启用「站点隔离」(Site Isolation) 和「增强安全模式」(enhanced-security-mode) 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21185","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2025/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21185.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-21185"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0647.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0784","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0784.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21325","title":"Microsoft Windows 安全内核模式特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 安全内核模式（Secure Kernel Mode）存在权限提升漏洞，其根源在于对关键资源的权限分配不当（CWE-732）。本地低权限攻击者可通过向安全内核发送特制的系统调用，利用该漏洞获取 SYSTEM 权限，从而完全控制目标系统，实现任意代码执行、数据窃取或安装持久化后门。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地登录能力，但无需用户交互，降低了利用门槛。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050021）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21325"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-17T01:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:06Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050021，将 Windows 11 22H2 升级至 OS Build 22621.4751、23H2 升级至 22631.4751。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。该漏洞需本地访问且需低权限，建议同时限制非管理用户本地登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21325","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/29c2ed08a73c612e5ed2935720296628adaebf63/2025/CVE-2025-21325/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2025/CVE-2025-21325.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/29c2ed08a73c612e5ed2935720296628adaebf63/2025/CVE-2025-21325/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0784.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0895","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0895.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21629","title":"Linux Kernel IPv6 硬件校验和卸载拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络子系统中，先前的提交禁用了在支持 NETIF_F_IPV6_CSUM 功能的网络设备上对携带 IPv6 扩展头数据包的硬件校验和卸载。BIG TCP 功能引入 IPV6_TLV_JUMBO IPv6 扩展头以传递巨型数据包长度信息，但该扩展头仅存在于 PF_PACKET 类抓包接口（如 tcpdump）中，并不会由物理网卡实际传输。由于内核校验和卸载检查逻辑未区分这一特殊情况，导致处理 BIG TCP 数据包时触发 skb_warn_bad_offload 内核告警。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 IPv6 BIG TCP 数据包触发该问题，造成内核告警及潜在的服务中断，影响使用 IPv6 和 BIG TCP 功能的 Linux 内核版本。CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21629"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:15Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:16:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：6.12.8、6.11.11、6.6.73、6.1.122、5.15.176、5.10.233、5.4.291 或更高版本。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 安全更新（linux-image-6.8.0-51-generic 等）。Red Hat/CentOS 用户请应用 RHSA-2025 对应补丁。若无法立即升级，可通过 sysctl 临时禁用 IPv6 扩展头处理：`sysctl -w net.ipv6.conf.all.disable_ipv6=1`（会影响 IPv6 连通性），或在网卡驱动层面关闭 NETIF_F_IPV6_CSUM 硬件卸载功能（`ethtool -K eth0 rx-csumming off tx-csumming off`），重启网络服务生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/68e068cabd2c6c533ef934c2e5151609cf6ecc6d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/95ccf006bbc8b59044313b8c309dcf29c546abd4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ac9cfef69565021c9e1022a493a9c40b03e2caf9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d3b7a9c7597b779039a51d7b34116fbe424bf2b7","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21629.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2025/CVE-2025-21629.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21629.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21629.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21629.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21629-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21629.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21629.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f6551b9664b7c57bdc824f681a941c2766269db/2025/CVE-2025-21629.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21629"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0895.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0396","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0396.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0448","title":"Google Chrome Compositing 实现不当导致界面欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 132.0.6834.83 之前版本的 Compositing（合成）组件中存在不当实现漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面并诱使用户访问，利用该漏洞实施 UI 欺骗攻击，使用户误认页面内容或来源。该漏洞影响所有基于 Chromium 132.0.6834.83 之前版本的浏览器，攻击复杂度低，无需特权，但需要用户交互配合。Google 已在 Chrome 132.0.6834.83 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0448"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:30Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 132.0.6834.83 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome 自动检查更新。使用 Chromium 内核的浏览器（如 Edge、Opera）需同步更新至对应版本。Linux 发行版用户通过包管理器更新 chromium 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/01/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_14.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/377948403","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0448.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0448.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0448.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-0448","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-fr5q-g65c-mjcx/GHSA-fr5q-g65c-mjcx.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-0448","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-0448.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/c/chromium/.rev","https://github.com/InfoSecREDD/CVE-Discord-Notify/blob/3f4b2b159624fda9a5cd9efcc2a46893068cd4db/seen_cves.txt","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/7789dc7d5cc682178db00a1e96d6521071f01a57/metadata/glsa/glsa-202507-07.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0396.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0395","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0395.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0447","title":"Google Chrome 导航不当实现权限提升漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 132.0.6834.83 之前版本的导航（Navigation）组件中存在不当实现漏洞（CWE-79），远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，利用该漏洞实现权限提升。成功利用后攻击者可获取高机密性、高完整性及高可用性影响，包括窃取敏感数据、篡改页面内容或执行任意代码。攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如点击链接）。Google 已在 Chrome 132.0.6834.83 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0447"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:29Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 132.0.6834.83 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 设置中的「关于 Chrome」自动检查更新。使用 Chromium 内核的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave）需同步更新至对应版本。无法立即更新时，建议禁用 JavaScript 解析不可信 HTML 页面作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/01/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_14.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/375550814","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0447.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0447.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0447.json","https